<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $55-3/8 ON WALL STREET.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $55-3/8 ON WALL STREET.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADS opened $0-7/8 higher at $55-3/8 in New York on Monday. The price corresponds to about 257.44 markka.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
